# Tools & Configuration

## Tailwind CSS

- Use Tailwind CSS for styling
- Tailwind configuration files in `boilerplate-theme/tailwind/`
- Main CSS file: `boilerplate-theme/tailwind.css`
- Build outputs:
    - Frontend: `boilerplate-theme/theme/style.css`
    - Editor: `boilerplate-theme/theme/style-editor.css`
    - Intellisense: `boilerplate-theme/tailwind-intellisense.css`
- Use PostCSS for CSS processing
- Production builds use `_TW_ENV=production` environment variable

## ESLint

- ESLint configuration in `boilerplate-theme/eslint.config.js`
- Use for JavaScript linting
- Follow ESLint rules and Prettier integration
- Run linting: `pnpm run lint:eslint`
- Auto-fix: `pnpm run lint-fix:eslint`

## Prettier

- Prettier configuration in `boilerplate-theme/prettier.config.js`
- Based on WordPress Prettier Config (`@wordpress/prettier-config`)
- Includes Tailwind CSS plugin (`prettier-plugin-tailwindcss`)
- Use for code formatting
- Run formatting check: `pnpm run lint:prettier`
- Auto-format: `pnpm run lint-fix:prettier`

## PHPCS (PHP CodeSniffer)

- PHPCS configuration in `boilerplate-theme/phpcs.xml`
- Run PHPCS from the package root: `composer install` then `composer php:lint`
- Text domains configured: `boilerplate-theme`, `boilerplate-plugin`
- Excludes: `vendor/`, `tests/`, `node_modules/`

## Build Tools

### esbuild

- JavaScript bundling tool
- Configuration in `package.json` scripts
- Builds JavaScript files from `boilerplate-theme/javascript/`
- Outputs minified files to `boilerplate-theme/theme/js/*.min.js`
- Also builds block editor files
- Production builds use `--minify` flag

### PostCSS

- CSS processing tool
- Configuration in `boilerplate-theme/postcss.config.js`
- Processes Tailwind CSS files
- Uses plugins: `postcss-import-ext-glob`, `postcss-nesting`, `postcss-advanced-variables`, `cssnano` (production)

## pnpm Scripts

### Development

- `pnpm run development` - Build all assets for development
- `pnpm run watch` - Watch mode for all assets
- `pnpm run dev` - Alias for development

### Linting

- `pnpm run lint` - Run all linters
- `pnpm run lint-fix` - Auto-fix all linting issues

### Production

- `pnpm run production` - Build all assets for production
- `pnpm run prod` - Alias for production
- `pnpm run bundle` - Production build + create zip

### Individual Tasks

- `pnpm run development:tailwind:frontend` - Build frontend CSS
- `pnpm run development:tailwind:editor` - Build editor CSS
- `pnpm run development:esbuild` - Build JavaScript
- `pnpm run development:esbuild:blocks` - Build block files
- `pnpm run development:copy-blocks` - Copy block files

## Important Notes

- Do not modify build configuration files without consultation
- Use existing pnpm scripts instead of running tools directly
- Minified files are automatically generated - do not edit manually
- Watch mode is available for development workflow
- Production builds optimize and minify assets
